GET http://localhost:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### ========== 🤖 AI: SIMILAR PRODUCTS (NCB Model) ==========
### Cara Kerja:
### 1. Input product → Generate 32D embedding (Neural Network)
### 2. Cosine similarity dengan semua produk
### 3. Return top-K most similar products

### 3. Similar Products - Udang Sedang
# Product ID: 7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c
# Expected: Cumi-cumi, Ikan Laut, Kerang (protein laut sejenis)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c?top_k=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Similar Products - Ayam Kampung
# Product ID: 70710b93-2b14-4674-a243-b919d6002c48
# Expected: Ayam lainnya, Daging Unggas (protein daging sejenis)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/70710b93-2b14-4674-a243-b919d6002c48?top_k=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Similar Products - Bawang Merah
# Product ID: 8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c
# Expected: Bawang Putih, Bumbu lain (kategori sama)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/similar/8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c?top_k=5
Accept: application/json

###

### ========== 🤖 AI: BUNDLE RECOMMENDATIONS (NCB Model) ==========
### Cara Kerja:
### 1. Input: Multiple products dari cart
### 2. Generate embeddings untuk semua products
### 3. Compute CENTROID (average vector)
### 4. Find products similar to centroid → Pelengkap bundle!

### 6. Bundle - Mix Protein Laut (2 produk seafood)
# Expected: Produk pelengkap seperti bumbu, sayur pendamping
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/bundle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_ids": [
    "7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c",
    "b3cc44f1-f3c1-4703-98d8-ac40cb387187"
  ],
  "top_k": 5
}

###

### 7. Bundle - Mix Protein & Bumbu (seafood + spices)
# Expected: Sayuran, bumbu tambahan, pelengkap masakan
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/bundle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_ids": [
    "7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c",
    "8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c"
  ],
  "top_k": 8
}

###

### 8. Bundle - Multiple Proteins (3 produk berbeda)
# Expected: Pelengkap masakan yang cocok untuk berbagai protein
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/recommendations/bundle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_ids": [
    "7a4af2f2-f55b-4300-a4ba-4406efcc350c",
    "70710b93-2b14-4674-a243-b919d6002c48",
    "8c7b5a2f-1e3d-4f9a-b8c6-3d4e5f6a7b8c"
  ],
  "top_k": 6
}

